12
00:58:00,000 --> 00:58:06,000
The film is produced by non-profit organization POWER UP.

13
01:02:50,000 --> 01:02:56,000
Itty Bitty Titty Committee had its world premiere at the film festival Berlinale on
February 9, 2007, where it was nominated for a Teddy Award for Best Feature.

14
